<p>Briefly open a radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 2, 3, 3, 4</acronym> rift in spacetime that teleports those within to the targeted location. Enemies will take <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">60, 81, 98, 111, 124</acronym> darkness and <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">60, 81, 98, 111, 124</acronym> temporal damage.</p><p>The power of this spell inflicts entropic backlash on you, causing you to take <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">120, 162, 195, 222, 247</acronym> damage over 8 turns. This damage counts as entropy for the purpose of Entropic Gift.</p><p>The damage will improve with your Spellpower.</p>